<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta shares fall 1.03 pct on profit taking.</title>
<headline>Jakarta shares fall 1.03 pct on profit taking.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jakarta share index fell 1.03 percent to 565.42 points in late trading on Monday due to profit taking almost across the board, brokers said.</p>
</text>
